OpenKara NetEase QuickJS source (org.openkara.netease-quickjs)
Copyright David Weng and contributors.

This package is distributed under AGPL-3.0-only (see LICENSE). It is a
Streaming Source plugin for OpenKara and runs on the embedded QuickJS
(`openkara-js`) runtime: `dist/entry.mjs` is a single self-contained ES module
built from `src/` (the AGPL corresponding source) with the pinned
devDependency esbuild@0.28.1 (see package.json/package-lock.json).

Wire ported from @neteasecloudmusicapienhanced/api 4.41.1 (see SOURCES.md):
request construction follows `module/*.js`, `util/createOption.js` and the
weapi/eapi branches of `util/request.js`; crypto follows `util/crypto.js`.
The adapter derives from the upstream implementation; the fixed upstream
MIT license and copyright notice are included in LICENSES/netease-api-MIT.txt.

Provider logic (search, liked tracks, playlists, details, rights mapping,
cursors, session) ported from the OpenKara NetEase Node source in this
repository (`packages/netease`), which is likewise AGPL-3.0-only.

Third-party build tooling (esbuild) is a development-only dependency and is
not shipped in the source archive.
